# Private per-student data - never committed, never bundled into a public
# build or release ZIP. See tools/import_personal_profile.py and
# backend/desktop_launcher.py's --import-profile flag.
user_profile.local.json
user_profile.local.*.json
**/user_profile.local*.json

# Source workbooks from the Academic Office. The student-batch workbook is a
# ROSTER (roll number, full name, year, batch, major for ~2,700 named people)
# and must never reach this public repo or a public deployment. Only the
# anonymous aggregate that tools/derive_batch_catalogue.py produces
# (backend/app/data/student_batches.json - batch, year, programme, headcount)
# is committed. Timetable workbooks are ignored too: they are inputs to
# tools/import_office_timetable_xlsx.py, whose normalized + checksummed output
# under backend/app/data/timetable_versions/ is the artifact worth versioning.
*.xlsx
*.xls
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, this also matched
# backend/app/data/student_batches.json - the ANONYMOUS derived catalogue that
# must ship - because the match is case-insensitive on Windows, silently
# excluding the very artifact this rule exists to make safe to publish.
/Student*Batches*

